        "comments": "The assembly mMinSch1.hap2.2 is based on 37x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. The order and orientation of contigs along the Y chromosome is uncertain between 6.6 Mb and 15.5 Mb.",
